WEBVTT

00:01.550 --> 00:03.850
This is checkmate, then.

00:07.430 --> 00:09.900
<i>I let my guard down because he was a kid.</i>

00:10.720 --> 00:13.380
<i>He used the dropped sword to cut his ropes,</i>

00:14.060 --> 00:16.700
<i>and defeated my lieutenant in an instant.</i>

00:24.860 --> 00:27.760
Th-This is...

00:29.090 --> 00:30.760
We'll charge in!

00:30.760 --> 00:32.900
Don't let any of those rats escape!

00:34.400 --> 00:36.090
Hold the line!

00:39.290 --> 00:44.350
<i>This is the tale of a genius patissier 
who died before his time,</i>

00:44.580 --> 00:48.330
<i>and was reincarnated as the son 
of a poor noble in another world</i>

00:48.640 --> 00:52.280
<i>to pursue a world full 
of desserts and smiles.</i>

00:52.570 --> 00:57.290
<i>It's a tale that is at once cold 
and unsparing, and syrupy sweet.</i>

00:58.750 --> 01:05.130
<i>His dream is to create this 
world's very own land of sweets!</i>

01:13.010 --> 01:15.590
<b>Sweet Reincarnation</b>

02:37.720 --> 02:38.650
There they are!

02:38.650 --> 02:40.650
Don't let them escape! Catch them!

02:43.320 --> 02:45.180
Lord Pastry...

02:45.720 --> 02:48.560
We'll be safe. Help has arrived.

02:50.250 --> 02:53.050
This is bad. Very bad...

02:50.660 --> 02:56.460
<b>Beloved Smiles and Baked Treats</b>

02:53.720 --> 02:57.610
It seems retreat is my only option.

02:58.110 --> 03:00.590
You think I'll let you escape that easily?

03:03.380 --> 03:04.310
Pas!

03:04.710 --> 03:06.790
Lord Pas! Are you safe?!

03:07.290 --> 03:08.800
I'm just fine!

03:08.800 --> 03:10.090
See to Lady Licorice!

03:10.090 --> 03:10.900
Glacage!

03:10.900 --> 03:11.500
Sir!

03:19.640 --> 03:21.850
<i>I'm at a disadvantage.</i>

03:22.640 --> 03:28.600
<i>Using the room hardest to escape from as 
a holding cell is working against me...</i>

03:29.250 --> 03:31.310
There's no way out for you now!

03:32.770 --> 03:35.310
If there's no way out, I'll make one!

03:39.340 --> 03:40.150
Magic?

03:40.390 --> 03:41.780
So long!

03:42.110 --> 03:42.820
Wait!

03:43.130 --> 03:44.360
Pas, no!

03:45.540 --> 03:46.770
Don't pursue.

03:48.290 --> 03:49.420
Understood.

03:53.030 --> 03:56.460
Honestly, son of mine...

03:56.910 --> 03:58.830
You bring me no end of worry.

04:00.670 --> 04:02.040
I'm sorry.

04:05.480 --> 04:07.850
I'm glad you're both safe.

04:08.530 --> 04:09.460
Yes, sir.

04:10.890 --> 04:11.540
Lord Pa—

04:11.540 --> 04:12.420
Kid!

04:14.090 --> 04:15.250
You okay?

04:16.480 --> 04:17.530
Lady Licorice!

04:17.530 --> 04:19.230
I'm so glad you're safe!

04:21.000 --> 04:24.800
Retainers from the houses 
of Kadlecek and Hubarek.

04:24.800 --> 04:25.860
Lady Licorice!

04:29.530 --> 04:30.470
Were you harmed?

04:30.470 --> 04:32.150
No... I'm fine.

04:32.150 --> 04:35.290
Return her to her father with all due haste.

04:35.290 --> 04:35.980
Sir!

04:37.150 --> 04:39.000
We'll take our leave now, then.

04:46.730 --> 04:48.470
Who turned out to be behind it?

04:48.970 --> 04:52.680
We arrested a man named Duke Luhaingo Armire.

04:53.500 --> 04:56.260
He was trying to slip out the back way.

04:57.100 --> 04:58.580
House Armire, eh?

04:59.000 --> 05:01.080
During the war twenty years ago,

05:01.080 --> 05:03.690
they were investigated and 
stripped of title, I believe.

05:03.690 --> 05:04.780
Yes.

05:04.780 --> 05:07.870
They were suspected of passing 
information to the enemy.

05:09.190 --> 05:10.830
You understand, Pas?

05:11.220 --> 05:18.260
The actions of a suzerain lord can 
alter the destiny of a whole family.

05:18.260 --> 05:19.020
Yes, sir.

05:19.600 --> 05:20.840
Lord Morteln!

05:21.730 --> 05:25.950
His Grace is in his estate, 
awaiting details of the incident.

05:26.910 --> 05:29.080
Will you accompany us in this carriage?

05:31.400 --> 05:32.470
Of course!

05:32.470 --> 05:35.110
We need to take care of the stragglers.

05:35.110 --> 05:37.620
Feuille, you handle the report!

05:37.620 --> 05:38.410
Hey!

05:38.410 --> 05:43.050
Since the opponent used magic to escape, 
we're the only ones who can pursue!

05:43.050 --> 05:43.690
Yes!

05:43.690 --> 05:44.690
Let's go, Pas!

05:44.690 --> 05:45.480
Right!

05:46.940 --> 05:48.910
Hang on a minute!

05:50.500 --> 05:54.120
Now, where do you think that man got off to?

05:58.360 --> 05:59.250
What's wrong?

06:00.250 --> 06:03.800
How could he possibly have escaped 
under those circumstances?

06:04.830 --> 06:06.590
When I approached the hole...

06:07.810 --> 06:11.780
I didn't sense much of the power 
from his spell's activation.

06:13.170 --> 06:17.570
You're suggesting he didn't 
have much power remaining?

06:19.270 --> 06:21.380
Even if he dug a hole to escape,

06:21.380 --> 06:24.620
he shouldn't have had enough power to go far.

06:25.370 --> 06:28.400
We have our forces surrounding the area.

06:28.870 --> 06:32.020
Could he really get away without being seen?

06:38.310 --> 06:43.060
If you can't escape, but need a 
way out of your predicament...

06:43.910 --> 06:47.430
Make it look like 
you've escaped, bide your time,

06:47.430 --> 06:50.970
then escape at your leisure 
once the enemy withdraws.

06:52.000 --> 06:54.680
That's how you do it.

06:55.000 --> 06:58.040
Magnificent. You saw through everything.

06:59.840 --> 07:04.820
Looks like I'll have to go 
through the two of you, then.

07:06.810 --> 07:09.990
I'll settle things with this ruffian.

07:11.600 --> 07:13.200
Let's see if you can back that up.

07:15.740 --> 07:18.400
My name is Pastry Mille Morteln.

07:18.910 --> 07:20.130
May I ask yours?

07:21.690 --> 07:24.590
I abandoned my family name ages ago.

07:25.250 --> 07:27.800
You can just call me Strudel.

07:28.640 --> 07:33.260
<i>Convenient that this kid 
wants a one-on-one duel.</i>

07:33.620 --> 07:38.050
<i>He might be a bit crafty, 
but he's still a kid.</i>

07:38.050 --> 07:40.580
<i>If I can pin him down and take him hostage,</i>

07:40.580 --> 07:43.190
<i>I might get myself a way out of this!</i>

07:46.300 --> 07:49.070
Nothing personal, brat!

07:49.070 --> 07:51.280
<i>Not good! His form is perfect!</i>

07:54.920 --> 07:55.880
What?!

08:04.340 --> 08:07.710
What the hell... trick... did you...

08:08.260 --> 08:10.020
A word of warning.

08:10.020 --> 08:14.580
On the battlefield, you must 
never lose sight of your weapon.

08:17.210 --> 08:19.210
Well done, Pas.

08:25.690 --> 08:28.250
This sword. Did you...

08:28.250 --> 08:29.070
Yes.

08:33.140 --> 08:33.990
<i>Replicate!</i>

08:38.200 --> 08:39.630
I see.

08:39.630 --> 08:43.450
Give your opponent a broken sword 
and provoke them into a duel...

08:44.540 --> 08:46.280
You had me scared to death.

08:46.800 --> 08:48.630
You sneaky rascal.

08:48.630 --> 08:51.240
I'd really prefer "clever"...

08:52.590 --> 08:56.630
<i>Although... at this rate...</i>

08:57.340 --> 09:01.140
<i>Am I ever going to be able 
to create my land of sweets?</i>

09:04.250 --> 09:08.500
<b>1 Month Later</b>

09:10.520 --> 09:11.980
<i>One month later,</i>

09:12.540 --> 09:14.500
<i>the official engagement 
party between Lord Squale</i>

09:14.500 --> 09:18.690
<i>and Lady Petra was held at the royal castle.</i>

09:22.070 --> 09:23.980
Thank you for coming.

09:22.780 --> 09:25.830
Lady Petra looks so happy!

09:25.830 --> 09:29.440
This is quite an event for something
 that was privately announced...

09:29.440 --> 09:31.810
Oh, Lord Morteln!

09:33.180 --> 09:34.970
So this is where you were.

09:35.420 --> 09:37.270
Duke Kadlecek!

09:37.270 --> 09:39.380
Congratulations on the engagement.

09:39.380 --> 09:42.430
I do not have the words to 
thank you for the invitation.

09:42.430 --> 09:43.820
Now, now...

09:43.820 --> 09:45.740
I should be thanking you.

09:45.740 --> 09:50.150
You're the reason we got through 
that trouble with no harm done.

09:50.720 --> 09:52.000
Lord Pastry...

09:52.640 --> 09:57.830
You have my gratitude for protecting 
my granddaughter-in-law, Lady Licorice.

09:58.290 --> 10:00.780
I did no more than a knight's duty.

10:01.590 --> 10:03.950
Lord Squale cuts a fine figure.

10:03.950 --> 10:07.440
Oh, he's so nervous, he's petrified.

10:07.440 --> 10:10.050
Not only is he being treated as a showpiece,

10:10.050 --> 10:14.600
he's also sitting next to his future bride, 
with whom he fell in love at first sight.

10:14.600 --> 10:19.240
Lord Squale seems quite 
fine to me. Vivacious, even.

10:19.240 --> 10:24.980
I was hoping the engagement 
might mature him somewhat...

10:25.770 --> 10:29.320
But if a man with your military 
accomplishments says he looks fine,

10:29.320 --> 10:32.400
perhaps I should reevaluate 
that grandson of mine.

10:32.870 --> 10:35.570
I thank you, Lord Pastry.

10:35.570 --> 10:36.890
I'm honored.

10:38.560 --> 10:39.960
By the way, Your Grace...

10:41.260 --> 10:45.080
There's something I'd like to 
confirm as regards this event.

10:45.320 --> 10:46.540
Oh?

10:46.910 --> 10:48.780
The recent kidnapping...

10:48.780 --> 10:51.770
I've noticed a few curious aspects to it...

10:52.090 --> 10:53.600
Curious aspects?

10:53.600 --> 10:54.290
Yes.

10:54.840 --> 10:59.530
Between the bandit's skill and his 
meticulousness in securing multiple strongholds,

10:59.530 --> 11:01.800
he seemed extremely prepared.

11:02.340 --> 11:08.310
Yet he made the fundamental and fatal 
mistake of kidnapping the wrong target.

11:08.760 --> 11:13.120
Could this have been the result of being fed

11:13.120 --> 11:16.780
misleading information regarding Lady Petra?

11:17.290 --> 11:20.250
And a fallen noble having 
the connections to prepare

11:20.250 --> 11:23.740
multiple bases of operations 
within the royal capital...

11:24.210 --> 11:25.680
Is such a thing really plausible?

11:26.590 --> 11:29.910
I can't escape the feeling 
that it doesn't add up.

11:32.180 --> 11:36.330
Incidentally, one thing that might explain it

11:36.330 --> 11:39.090
would be if there were a third party at work

11:39.310 --> 11:41.300
with their own objective in mind.

11:42.120 --> 11:43.740
A third party?

11:43.740 --> 11:45.590
A third party to release 
the misleading information,

11:45.590 --> 11:47.560
prepare connections in a roundabout way,

11:47.890 --> 11:52.310
and overlook the Armire 
at large in the capital.

11:53.210 --> 11:56.190
Oh? And who might the third party be?

11:57.660 --> 12:01.400
Surely, the figure with the most 
to gain from what happened.

12:02.650 --> 12:03.610
Gain?

12:03.950 --> 12:06.970
If they've earned House Armire's ire,

12:07.420 --> 12:10.180
it must be someone who gained 
power after their fall.

12:12.000 --> 12:16.250
The someone would want to use 
the incident to cut off any

12:16.250 --> 12:19.770
remaining chance of the resentful 
House Armire's resurrection...

12:19.770 --> 12:21.080
Enough!

12:23.490 --> 12:26.720
Are you suggesting that the "someone" is me?

12:31.780 --> 12:33.010
Certainly not, Your Grace.

12:33.010 --> 12:34.920
I simply have a wild imagination.

12:35.250 --> 12:39.360
Children love their tall tales, as you know.

12:40.460 --> 12:43.290
<i>I took him for a mere whelp...</i>

12:43.290 --> 12:44.920
<i>But this is absurd.</i>

12:44.920 --> 12:47.970
<i>The very definition of biting 
the hand that feeds you!</i>

12:48.830 --> 12:49.370
Pas...

12:54.820 --> 12:56.180
Now, Your Grace.

12:56.180 --> 12:58.500
Regarding an entirely separate matter...

12:59.980 --> 13:01.940
As you may know,

13:01.940 --> 13:04.620
our fief is a land with few crops to harvest.

13:05.060 --> 13:07.130
I have a few measures I'd like to take,

13:07.130 --> 13:08.920
but lacking the proper groundwork...

13:10.090 --> 13:11.770
Money, you mean?

13:12.920 --> 13:17.030
I would be truly pleased if a man 
possessed of Your Grace's wisdom

13:17.030 --> 13:20.150
would have sympathy for our 
situation and, perhaps, offer aid.

13:21.840 --> 13:24.750
You never miss a trick, do you?

13:24.750 --> 13:30.120
And... if I were to say such 
aid were beyond my abilities?

13:30.890 --> 13:33.830
I might suffer an errant slip of the tongue.

13:34.160 --> 13:34.930
What?!

13:35.950 --> 13:38.590
You see the margrave over there?

13:39.610 --> 13:42.750
We were about to go pay him our regards.

13:43.740 --> 13:48.720
If I were, with a child's carelessness, 
to let slip my earlier tall tale—

13:48.720 --> 13:50.840
Fine! I surrender.

13:51.550 --> 13:54.220
I'll provide all the aid you require.

13:57.570 --> 13:59.190
You honor me, my lord.

13:59.190 --> 14:01.090
You got the better of me.

14:02.230 --> 14:05.150
Now I'm going to say something, 
but I'm speaking to myself.

14:05.540 --> 14:06.610
My lord?

14:07.520 --> 14:10.730
As I'm speaking to myself, 
I'll kindly ask that you ignore it.

14:12.070 --> 14:16.830
I perceived a chance to destroy an 
opposing faction in one fell swoop.

14:17.370 --> 14:22.290
I gave the order to leak information 
that would encourage a kidnapping.

14:22.900 --> 14:23.850
However...

14:24.750 --> 14:29.700
My aim was most certainly not to 
put my darling grandson's fiancee,

14:29.700 --> 14:31.720
or her younger sister, in danger.

14:32.390 --> 14:37.430
I'll admit that I arranged the entire affair.

14:37.890 --> 14:39.990
And no matter what excuse I might make,

14:39.990 --> 14:42.890
the truth is that I did put 
Lady Licorice in danger.

14:42.890 --> 14:44.900
I humbly acknowledge the accusations,

14:44.900 --> 14:46.610
and will henceforth reflect on my conduct.

14:47.070 --> 14:49.500
I appreciate the warning.

14:49.500 --> 14:50.160
However...

14:50.510 --> 14:54.660
To extort me like this, so brazenly, 
suggests tremendous cunning.

14:54.660 --> 14:56.550
You are speaking to yourself still, right?

14:56.550 --> 14:58.150
Of course I was!

14:58.150 --> 14:59.530
Lord Morteln!

15:00.670 --> 15:03.450
Lord Hubarek. We were 
about to pay our respects.

15:03.450 --> 15:04.940
Lord Casserole!

15:04.940 --> 15:07.340
Oh! Your son is here as well!

15:07.980 --> 15:11.270
I must offer my gratitude 
to Lord Pastry as well.

15:11.270 --> 15:12.850
Once more, I thank you.

15:12.850 --> 15:14.800
I-I'm honored...

15:14.800 --> 15:19.180
You've undergone your 
Sanctification Ceremony already, have you not?

15:19.560 --> 15:21.760
Y-Yes.

15:21.760 --> 15:24.380
<i>Is he going to bring me 
some moneymaking scheme?</i>

15:24.380 --> 15:30.900
Well, a man of your abilities might find 
himself with many admirers very soon.

15:30.900 --> 15:34.820
Of course, it's never too 
early to settle down!

15:35.110 --> 15:37.040
R-Right...

15:37.040 --> 15:40.750
Do you have your heart 
set on anyone just yet?

15:41.020 --> 15:44.960
Well... I'm still young, after all.

15:44.960 --> 15:47.010
So if you do find the right person,

15:47.010 --> 15:50.670
you will settle down in the future, yes?

15:51.530 --> 15:51.840
Pa--

15:51.840 --> 15:55.330
I'm afraid I haven't met the 
right person yet, though.

15:56.280 --> 15:59.850
What would you think of my daughter, then?

16:02.090 --> 16:03.770
<i>Oh, hell.</i>

16:05.980 --> 16:09.940
B-But... Lady Petra is recently engaged...

16:10.210 --> 16:12.130
Don't be ridiculous.

16:12.130 --> 16:15.570
It's not only Petra who recently came of age.

16:16.490 --> 16:18.080
I refer to Licorice.

16:19.850 --> 16:22.080
L-Lady Licorice?

16:22.370 --> 16:25.570
She seems to find the idea quite pleasing.

16:25.570 --> 16:28.550
Er... well... I...

16:29.040 --> 16:31.020
I'm certainly honored, but...

16:31.760 --> 16:34.170
Surely I'm unworthy.

16:34.630 --> 16:37.830
Surely Lady Licorice would 
prefer a better match...

16:39.640 --> 16:43.860
You said earlier you'd settle 
down with the right person...

16:43.860 --> 16:48.980
Does this mean you find my 
daughter deficient in some way?

16:49.440 --> 16:51.210
Oh, of course not...

16:51.210 --> 16:52.030
<i>This is so bad.</i>

16:52.850 --> 16:54.990
<i>Look at him squirm!</i>

16:54.990 --> 16:57.720
I c-certainly meant nothing of the kind...

16:57.720 --> 17:00.450
You would accept my daughter, then?

17:02.550 --> 17:05.900
<i>Um... well? What the...</i>

17:06.330 --> 17:07.890
Are we agreed, then?

17:08.420 --> 17:15.400
W-Well... I can't deny that Lady 
Licorice a splendid woman, but...

17:16.420 --> 17:18.550
Do you agree as well, Lord Casserole?

17:19.330 --> 17:22.010
<i>He's half-threatening us.</i>

17:23.190 --> 17:25.770
Our family would be honored.

17:25.770 --> 17:27.730
<i>Father?!</i>

17:28.090 --> 17:30.000
It's settled, then!

17:31.850 --> 17:34.080
Assemble the household!

17:34.080 --> 17:34.940
Milord!

17:34.940 --> 17:37.930
Gather the Kadleceks as well, then!

17:37.930 --> 17:40.410
Hey! Staff!

17:44.890 --> 17:46.090
Lord Pastry...

17:46.090 --> 17:47.330
With Licorice?

17:47.730 --> 17:51.200
The heir to the Fief of 
Morteln is engaged already!

17:51.200 --> 17:54.720
Send the riders to all lands at once!

17:54.720 --> 17:59.610
How wonderful! He saved 
Lady Licorice himself, after all!

17:59.610 --> 18:01.430
<i>This is weird...</i>

18:01.430 --> 18:04.160
<i>I feel like I set out to 
make some choux a la creme,</i>

18:04.160 --> 18:08.850
<i>but ended up making a giant wedding cake...</i>

18:07.600 --> 18:08.850
And there she is now!

18:10.100 --> 18:11.270
<i>What's that smell?</i>

18:17.200 --> 18:18.930
Lord Pastry...

18:18.930 --> 18:23.210
I truly must thank you for 
saving me the other day.

18:23.550 --> 18:25.930
Forgive me for not saying so earlier...

18:27.210 --> 18:30.540
She's beautiful!

18:28.590 --> 18:31.170
<i>Was she always this charming?</i>

18:31.600 --> 18:33.880
Attention, all in attendance!

18:34.290 --> 18:37.520
I, Donachel Mille Hubarek,

18:37.520 --> 18:42.170
have, on this day, found partners 
for my two daughters!

18:42.490 --> 18:45.490
One, Lord Squale Kadlecek!

18:46.880 --> 18:51.110
The other, Lord Pastry Morteln!

18:53.690 --> 18:58.720
Which means House Kadlecek takes as a 
grandchild not only these beautiful girls,

18:58.720 --> 19:02.660
but the son of that great 
hero, Lord Casserole!

19:02.660 --> 19:05.620
A toast to this auspicious day!

19:05.620 --> 19:07.830
A toast!

19:13.540 --> 19:14.520
Lord Pas!

19:15.070 --> 19:17.750
We're to be brothers-in-law.

19:23.470 --> 19:25.730
Isn't it wonderful?

19:26.110 --> 19:27.860
I'm happy, too.

19:28.700 --> 19:31.660
Lord Squale... Lady Petra...

19:32.170 --> 19:34.120
Feel free to call me "Elder Brother"!

19:34.530 --> 19:36.940
And I... you may call "Elder Sister."

19:36.940 --> 19:39.610
That's... a little soon for me...

19:53.410 --> 19:56.810
<i>It happened so quickly, it doesn't feel real.</i>

19:57.180 --> 19:58.570
Lord Pastry?

19:59.880 --> 20:01.770
Oh... Lady Licorice.

20:02.640 --> 20:03.600
I...

20:04.120 --> 20:05.010
What is it?

20:06.840 --> 20:10.430
Am I... disappointing to you?

20:13.880 --> 20:15.020
Not at all.

20:16.170 --> 20:17.700
I'm very happy to have you!

20:18.860 --> 20:22.530
A-As am I... I'm just delighted!

20:22.880 --> 20:25.650
Please take care of me.

20:26.040 --> 20:27.080
I ask the same.

20:28.280 --> 20:30.400
So... I...

20:30.710 --> 20:35.710
I tried to make handmade sweets 
based on what you gave us.

20:35.960 --> 20:37.670
What I gave you?

20:42.030 --> 20:43.690
Oh, cookies!

20:45.160 --> 20:48.550
<i>Was that the lovely aroma I smelled?</i>

20:48.910 --> 20:51.510
Please, help yourself!

20:51.510 --> 20:52.410
I'd love to!

20:54.960 --> 20:57.040
<i>A beautiful golden brown!</i>

20:57.040 --> 21:00.930
<i>She got the baking time and the 
resting of the dough just right.</i>

21:03.030 --> 21:05.450
<i>And I think she used high-quality flour!</i>

21:06.850 --> 21:08.380
<i>It will have to be...</i>

21:17.380 --> 21:18.630
<i>This is...</i>

21:19.790 --> 21:21.690
<i>pretty salty.</i>

21:24.030 --> 21:25.970
Um... so...

21:27.250 --> 21:28.510
It's... delicious!

21:28.770 --> 21:30.120
Really?!

21:30.120 --> 21:33.080
Oh, are they really?

21:33.080 --> 21:34.360
I'm so glad.

21:40.080 --> 21:43.620
<i>I'll protect her smile 
for the rest of my life.</i>

21:44.890 --> 21:47.530
<i>No matter what hardship 
befalls us, I'll work hard.</i>

21:48.160 --> 21:50.850
<i>With her by my side, I know I can make it...</i>

21:49.060 --> 21:50.850
May I have another?

21:50.850 --> 21:51.830
Of course!

21:53.510 --> 21:55.930
<i>This world's very own land of sweets.</i>

22:02.940 --> 22:04.410
<i>Good and salty...</i>

23:37.050 --> 23:39.220
Next time on <i>Sweet Reincarnation</i>...

